# Local development secrets. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
#
# The platform currently needs no secrets to run: authentication uses
# per-user passwords in D1, and there is no third-party integration.
# This file exists for the optional tuning values below and as the place
# to put secrets you add.
#
# Anything sensitive belongs here for local dev and in
# `wrangler secret put NAME` for deployed environments — never in
# wrangler.jsonc, which is committed by some deployers.

# PBKDF2-SHA256 iterations for password hashing. Also settable as a plain
# var in wrangler.jsonc; override here to test a different cost locally.
